on in the “ Zollernalb ” of south-western Germany (Dietze et al. 2019). In the Subbetic, S. (S.) schlumbergeri occurs in the Laeviuscula Zone (Laeviuscula Subzone) and in the Propinquans Zone (Patella Subzone) of Sierra de Alta Coloma area (sections JAC 3, JAC 4, JAC 11, JAC 13, JAC 22 and JAQ 1; Jaén Province).","","text","",""]]},"T3RM":{"d":[["N-Ethiopia","","text","",""]]},"T4YNW":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"TJDD":{"d":[["","BZL","tdwg","",""]]},"V3TT5":{"d":[["China","","text","",""]]},"V3XKZ":{"d":[["South America","","text","",""]]},"V3XL9":{"d":[["Australia","","text","",""]]},"VBNRN":{"d":[["Hunan","48060","mrgid","",""]]},"VBRJR":{"d":[["Missouri","48300","mrgid","",""],["Texas","48473","mrgid","",""]]},"VC5C5":{"d":[["Australia (Western Australia, South Australia, Queensland, New South Wales, Victoria, Capital Territory)","","text","",""]]},"WTG4":{"d":[["","KEN-OO","tdwg","native",""],["Kenya, Tanzania (Zanzibar), ?Somalia","","text","native",""]]},"YNLS":{"d":[["","CLM","tdwg","",""]]}}